Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target. I can't wait for you. I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't wait for you. I'm going to
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake you up. I'm going to wake you up.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wake you\Nup I'm going to go back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the next day, I'm\Ngoing to fight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight for you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, Archnemon and Mummymon\Nuncovered their evil plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were the culprits who\Nkidnapped the lost children
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the city and had now\Nforced Ken to join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our heroes discovered that Demon and\Nthe other monsters were also after Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:02:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do these new villains have\Nin store for the boy genius?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(320,316)}Deadly Struggle with the Dark Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and the Seeds of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give Ken back, you creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, come and get him if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back! Come back! Okay! Hop in! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Joe's big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll save your pal, Ken.\NI promise. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn to keep your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you'd let them\Ngo if I came with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, do you want to go, children?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Ken Ichijoji, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I've always wanted to\Ncome face to face with my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not only a genius,\Nbut a great athlete, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you're so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tall man said he could also\Nmake all of my dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I so envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These children all treat you like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Temper, temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten me\Nalready, young friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember your\Nbig brother's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Osamo's funeral? What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tall man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think you\Ncan escape from Master Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's LadyDevimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the car! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyo! Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a score to settle\Nwith that Lady Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have that much\Npower and energy left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help me and DNA Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem with me, Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Kyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we can stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do whatever\Nit takes to beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come back for you\Nlater, guys. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.78,0:05:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Hawkmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon changes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Vigilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silphymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yukio Oikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dad and I used to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so sad and upset\Nat the funeral, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart almost broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I did the only thing\NI could to help you is the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By a simple letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who sent me the email.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, it was my way of helping you\Nget rid of the lingering pain you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, of course you've met my servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather say they're like family to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they prefer to address\Nme as their lord and master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell me, what are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukio, or whatever your name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scalcettomon and Lady\NDevimon, what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what business do they have\Nwith Erethimon and Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkness Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn, they're still behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like in the movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if we get caught by the police,\Nthey're gonna get me a license for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going, Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A train's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no choice but to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything but\Nwait for the train to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys. Let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still catch up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready to leave after the transplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why have you been\Nfollowing me all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized something when I first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had doubts at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but later it was confirmed that\Nyou had the Seeds of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Seeds of Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seeds that have made\Nyou smart and quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the real talent behind the genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I told these children\Nabout the Seeds of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkness that have made\Nyou so famous and admired,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all seem to want it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want to disappoint\Nyour loving little fans, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they really wanted was\Nto be just like you, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me have those seeds\Nthat you've been keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you do then, Yukio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm afraid\Nthat it's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seeds are nothing but\Ndata implanted in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, own still while I scan you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, who wants to go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.07,0:11:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear the stars whispering?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're speaking softly to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,telling us that our being here proves\Nthat we are each other's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start with that nonsense again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, face it, Arachnemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were meant to be together, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But darling, you can find a better mommy\Nthan me in this whole wild world. Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but I don't go\Nfor guys who talk to stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:12:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then please tell me exactly what\Nkind of guy you go for, Arachnemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to make you\Nhappy. Believe me, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then stop pestering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Arachnemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you, you're\Nsuch a coward, Atsunari!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see how precious you are, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Digimon are after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better go and find another route, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, officer, we have a truck\Nfull of children to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're trying\Nto fool, but you better go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it goes! Step on it, shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:12:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Marine Devimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here while I go after the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, V-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon, Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bond of Friendship! Light them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Wormmon, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go and take care of Marine Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we going to destroy him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madgemon, Evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madgemon, change!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D.A. Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:14:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! See them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Top Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkness wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claim bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this place at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who\Ncan destroy that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, dude, check her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The woman of my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away before you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oz, get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This shield will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come get me if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the road to... Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikari Oka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikari Oka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I remember, it's where Tai\Nand Hikari first met the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say there's a secret\Ngate there to your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, does Archnemon and\NMammon know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikari Oka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a very ironic name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what I'm\Ntalking about, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hickory means light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light means good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after I'm through with that quaint\Nlittle city, nothing good will remain there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll make it dark gaoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see I'm doing a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all the innocent faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, no one shall dare\Ntake them for granted anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can fight back if\Nyou want to, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or this pathetic boy, too\Nprecious to destroy. No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe as long as I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:18:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the meanest, ugliest, and most\Ncoward Digimon of all! You witch! No, Kyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I try my best to be very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it comes to\Ndealing with the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you shall pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I destroyed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroyed a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, man. It's over. Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing yourself\Nin front of the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some patients may not be able\Nto get out of there on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get that monster away from the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're already too near. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better do what we can\Nto save those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a med student anymore,\Nbut I still end up saving lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever said that only doctors can\Nlend a hand in saving people's lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father was a policeman, and\Nhe gave his life to save another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yori. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, did I do the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they ever give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance, Lighdramon. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will shake them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a bumpy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a better plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.72,0:21:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Daemon!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the power to give you?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.21,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:22:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always know. I always
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know. I always know.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always know
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.24,0:22:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person. The
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerful magic of the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of the\NImperialdramon is not enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.76,0:22:59.48,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\fscx120\fscy120\pos(320,323)}The Dark Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is still

